### 1. Create Authors
POST http://localhost:8080/demo_war_exploded/api/authors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "J.K. Rowling"
}

###
POST http://localhost:8080/demo_war_exploded/api/authors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "George Orwell"
}

### 2. Create Books (linked to Author IDs 1 and 2)
POST http://localhost:8080/demo_war_exploded/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Harry Potter and the Philosopher's Stone",
  "authorId": 1
}

###
POST http://localhost:8080/demo_war_exploded/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "1984",
  "authorId": 2
}

### 3. Create Users
POST http://localhost:8080/demo_war_exploded/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alice Smith"
}

###
POST http://localhost:8080/demo_war_exploded/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bob Jones"
}

### 4. Create a Loan (User 1 borrows Book 1)
POST http://localhost:8080/demo_war_exploded/api/users/1/loans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookId": 1
}